# Trade the strategy only when the strategy itself just lost twice in a
# row. The streak is counted on a shadow book that takes every signal,
# including the ones this gate turns down — so declining a trade never
# changes what the counter sees. Yesterday's fill is realized
# information; conditioning on it carries no lookahead. Specified from
# field results by Sunil Kumar: the money in his flat book lived almost
# entirely in the trades taken after consecutive losses.

strategy "Loss Streak Reentry"

universe $SPY
timeframe 1d

when [rsi] < 35 and price above [sma 200]
  buy [risk 1%]

sell when [rsi] > 60
  or [stop 4%]
  or [after 15 bars]

risk [after_losses 2]
